Belvedere is one of the great old [[Org/index|Orgs]], founded soon after the Dark
Ages ended and Aurelia brought the Gods' graces to [[Færrin]].

### What Have You Become?

The [[Watcher With 1,000 Eyes|Watcher]] gave the first Provost a mandate to chronicle
the planet. Few places concentrate [[Fanes]] and [[Hearts]] as densely.
